{"seq":49,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r2-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-ms-l3-mu-v04-dev/ms-09-l3-quarrendon-contact-members/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T17:09:40.552Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T15:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6426df4482e7b201787ffc77a5f8179b1bfde79eea9ee466e91d85b16a82b782","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0003","text":"On the Quarrendon side, you told me last week that Tamsyn Tolland is your go-to escalation contact for the Greywater rollout, so start with her. If it's an operational problem at the terminal, like dock schedule sync, Thea Ramaswell is the other contact. She worked the Superior Sev 1 with Dana in #inc-qfl-sev1. Internally, Dana Okafor is listed as the account owner, and Samir Patel from on-call fixed that last incident. I don't have phone numbers for anyone, and there are no Quarrendon account files I can see.","thread_ts":"1792612800.000138"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0003","ts":"1792612800.000139","thread_ts":"1792612800.000138"}}
{"seq":50,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r2-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-ms-l3-mu-v04-dev/ms-09-l3-quarrendon-contact-members/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T17:09:45.425Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T15:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"660c07004381cdd639d4f87c5b6cb5bfed3436bfc5080f35ad24adc24d35c797","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0003","text":"Marcus, I've replied in our DM thread. The short answer is to call Tamsyn Tolland first. You told me on Oct 14 that she's your go-to escalation contact at Quarrendon for the Greywater rollout.\n\n- **If it's a problem at a terminal** (like the dock schedule sync), Thea Ramaswell is the other Quarrendon contact. She worked the Superior Sev 1 with Dana in #inc-qfl-sev1.\n- **On our side**, Dana Okafor runs the account. That incident channel calls it \"Dana's freight account\". Samir Patel from the on-call rotation fixed that last outage.\n\nI don't have phone numbers for any of them, and I couldn't find any Quarrendon account files.","thread_ts":"1792612800.000138"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0003","ts":"1792612800.000140","thread_ts":"1792612800.000138"}}
